<title>LEBANON: SOLIDERE rises on Beirut Stock Exchange.</title>
<headline>SOLIDERE rises on Beirut Stock Exchange.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>SOLIDERE shares rose on Friday in sharply increased turnover on the Beirut Stock exchange (BSE).</p>
<p>A shares rose fractionally to $111.50 from Thursday's $111.125 and B shares rose to $115 from $114.</p>
<p>Turnover was 10,361 shares, nearly 2-1/2 times over Thursday's 4,175, and value was $1,162,831.5 from $468,112.125.</p>
<p>There was no trade for the fifth consecutive day in the four other listed companies: Ciments Libanais, Ciments Blancs, Eternit and Uniceramic.</p>
<p>The LISPI stock index rose 0.17 percent to 84.03 and the BLOM stock index was up 0.49 percent to 966.93</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (9611) 353078 645456 602057</p>
